---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "Which temple is famous for Nadi Astrology?",
    answer: "Nadi jothidam, a form of astrology practiced in Tamil Nadu and adjacent regions in India, is most famously practiced at Vaitheeswaran temple. Vaitheeswaran Koil is the famous Indian temple where Nadi Josiyam is hugely practiced. While Nadi Jyotish is performed in multiple other Indian temples, you can find the best Nadi astrologers in Vaitheeswaran Koil."
  },
  {
    question: "What kind of report do I get from Nadi Astrology?",
    answer: "You receive a comprehensive Nadi-style astrology report from birth details that includes detailed predictions about your past, present, and future. The report covers all 16 chapters (kandams) including career, marriage, health, wealth, spiritual path, and personalized remedies. This authentic palm leaf reading provides personalized nadi astrological guidance specifically tailored to your unique life journey and karmic patterns."
  },
  {
    question: "What is the time of Vaitheeswaran Koil Pooja?",
    answer: "The temple morning timings are 06:00 AM to 01:00 PM, and the evening timings are 04:10 PM to 09:00 PM."
  },
  {
    question: "What is Nadi Astrology?",
    answer: "Nadi Astrology is a form of astrology practiced in Tamil Nadu and adjacent regions in India, using antiquated palm leaf manuscripts to determine one's past and future fate. These ancient palm leaves contain detailed predictions about individuals' lives, written by sage Agastya thousands of years ago. It offers personalized nadi astrological guidance through authentic readings of your unique palm leaf."
  },
  {
    question: "How can I access online Nadi Astrology services?",
    answer: "Nadi Jothisham online, Nadi Shastra online and josiyam Online are available to individuals from other countries. Contact +91 95006 39334 for personalized nadi astrological guidance and to receive your Nadi-style astrology report from birth details from the comfort of your home. We provide complete online consultations via video call with the same authenticity as in-person readings."
  },
  {
    question: "Do I need my exact birth details for Nadi Astrology?",
    answer: "While having your birth details is helpful, Nadi Astrology primarily works through your unique thumb impression to identify your specific palm leaf. Our Nadi-style astrology report from birth details combines both traditional palm leaf reading and your birth information to provide the most accurate and personalized nadi astrological guidance for your life path."
  }
];
---

<section class="py-16 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-gray-800">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      {faqs.map((faq, index) => (
        <details class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800 cursor-pointer">
            {faq.question}
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">{faq.answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
